  "translation": "On a weekend morning, Xiaoming and his mother went to the park together. There were many flowers and trees in the park. They first went to the left side of the lake. The color of the lake water was very blue. Xiaoming saw a few ducks swimming in the lake. Mom asked, \"Can you feed the ducks?\" Xiaoming said, \"I can't swim, but I can feed them.\" Mom took out a piece of bread from her bag. Xiaoming was throwing the bread into the lake, and the ducks immediately all swam over. At this moment, a child ran over and asked, \"Can I feed with you?\" Xiaoming said, \"Of course!\" They fed together for a long time. Finally, they sat on the bench to rest and felt very happy today."
